*.db
*.sqlite

# Date locale
majordom-financiar/data/

# Real broker/bank exports dropped locally for testing an import feature —
# never tracked, regardless of filename/format. A real XTB export briefly
# landed in tools/investment-manager/docs/samples/ (2026-09-12, caught before
# any commit) — this exists so that mistake can't happen again, for this app
# or any future one with the same "drop a real export here to test against"
# pattern.
tools/*/docs/samples/

